  "plain": "At Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, where a flying saucer with alien bodies is said to have crashed in 1948, an aerial view later showed trees standing in neat lines, as if the site had been replanted. Scott Ramsey, a researcher who has spent years on the Aztec case and says he saw the aerial view, tells this on the show as a sign that someone cleaned up the site after the crash."
